At least bigyan mo ako ng kape ko.

144
00:12:26.287 --> 00:12:27.329
salamat po.

145
00:12:38.132 --> 00:12:41.552
Sa wakas lumalabas na kasal ka na.

146
00:12:41.635 --> 00:12:43.137
So anong klaseng kasal yan?

147
00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:46.056
Hindi man lang ako mahinahon magdala
