Kaso lang, hindi ko sinabi kahit kanino.

170
00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.404
Tahimik niyang ginawa ang lahat.

171
00:13:43.155 --> 00:13:44.657
Ito lang ang

172
00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:47.159
